{"url":"https://files.alkamelcloud.com/wec/results_noticeboard/14_2026/05_6%20Hours%20of%20Sao%20Paulo/055_Doc%2055%20-%20RACE%20DIRECTOR%20COMMUNICATION%20N.042026.pdf","sha256":"ef19a88b4d25b1ea5de1d3ff6677da4203eb2222901f24c786c4eeb4fd3f8147","retrieved":"2026-11-24T11:27:21.049Z","pages":[{"page":1,"width":595.25,"height":842,"items":[{"s":"FIA WEC 2026","x":71,"y":790,"w":53.5,"h":8},{"s":"001 Race Director Communication","x":233.6,"y":790,"w":122.2,"h":8},{"s":"Page 1 of 2","x":478.2,"y":790,"w":41,"h":8},{"s":"2026 Season","x":237.3,"y":117.5,"w":121.4,"h":20},{"s":"From:","x":76.5,"y":160,"w":27.8,"h":12},{"s":"the Race Director","x":144.6,"y":159.8,"w":76.7,"h":12},{"s":"Communication N∫","x":381.2,"y":160,"w":87.6,"h":12},{"s":"0","x":471.4,"y":160,"w":5.5,"h":12},{"s":"4","x":476.9,"y":160,"w":5.5,"h":12},{"s":"/20","x":482.4,"y":160,"w":13.7,"h":12},{"s":"2","x":496.2,"y":160,"w":5.5,"h":12},{"s":"6","x":501.7,"y":160,"w":5.5,"h":12},{"s":"To:","x":76.5,"y":179.8,"w":15.3,"h":12},{"s":"all Entrants in the Championship","x":144.6,"y":181.5,"w":179.3,"h":14},{"s":"Clarification regarding Track Limits for the rest of the 2026 season","x":77,"y":216.6,"w":441.7,"h":14},{"s":"Until further notice the following will apply:","x":76.5,"y":244.8,"w":222.9,"h":12},{"s":"In the 2026 Drivers’ season Briefing notes it is written in point 14:","x":76.5,"y":272.3,"w":344.8,"h":12},{"s":"14 - Track limits must be respected at all times.","x":76.5,"y":300.1,"w":251,"h":12},{"s":"•","x":97.8,"y":313.9,"w":4.2,"h":12},{"s":"Track limits violations will be monitored and listed on a timing page.","x":105.3,"y":313.9,"w":357.5,"h":12},{"s":"•","x":97.8,"y":327.6,"w":4.2,"h":12},{"s":"Track limits are counted by driver by session. The race is considered as one","x":106.1,"y":327.6,"w":413,"h":12},{"s":"session.","x":112.1,"y":341.4,"w":44.3,"h":12},{"s":"•","x":97.8,"y":355.4,"w":4.2,"h":12},{"s":"During FP, warm up or race:","x":105.3,"y":355.4,"w":151,"h":12},{"s":"- 4","x":112,"y":369.1,"w":13.9,"h":12},{"s":"th","x":126,"y":365.1,"w":6.7,"h":8},{"s":"offence in the session: warning flag.","x":136.1,"y":369.1,"w":191,"h":12},{"s":"- 5","x":112,"y":382.9,"w":13.9,"h":12},{"s":"th","x":126,"y":378.9,"w":6.7,"h":8},{"s":"offence and more in the session: a report to the Stewards for each one.","x":136.1,"y":382.9,"w":378.4,"h":12},{"s":"•","x":97.8,"y":396.6,"w":4.2,"h":12},{"s":"During all sessions, track limit infringements will lead to the deletion of the lap","x":105.6,"y":396.6,"w":413.4,"h":12},{"s":"time.","x":112.1,"y":410.4,"w":26.1,"h":12},{"s":"•","x":97.8,"y":424.4,"w":4.2,"h":12},{"s":"In certain circuits abusing track limits in the last turn may entail the loss of the","x":105.6,"y":424.4,"w":413.5,"h":12},{"s":"relevant and the next lap.","x":112.1,"y":438.1,"w":135,"h":12},{"s":"As stated above, on the fourth track limit a driver will get a warning flag.","x":76.5,"y":465.6,"w":378.8,"h":12},{"s":"From","x":76.5,"y":479.4,"w":28,"h":12},{"s":"the","x":112,"y":479.4,"w":16.7,"h":12},{"s":"fifth","x":136.2,"y":479.4,"w":19.2,"h":12},{"s":"onwards","x":162.9,"y":479.4,"w":45.7,"h":12},{"s":"a","x":216.1,"y":479.4,"w":6.7,"h":12},{"s":"report","x":230.4,"y":479.4,"w":31.3,"h":12},{"s":"per","x":269.1,"y":479.4,"w":17.5,"h":12},{"s":"subsequent","x":294.1,"y":479.4,"w":62.3,"h":12},{"s":"track","x":363.8,"y":479.4,"w":26,"h":12},{"s":"limit","x":397.3,"y":479.4,"w":21.5,"h":12},{"s":"to","x":426.2,"y":479.4,"w":9.9,"h":12},{"s":"the","x":443.7,"y":479.4,"w":16.7,"h":12},{"s":"stewards,","x":467.9,"y":479.4,"w":51.9,"h":12},{"s":"technical conditions allowing, this warning flag will be a Black and White flag","x":76.5,"y":493.4,"w":442.5,"h":12},{"s":"presented either at the Race Director's signaling booth, or/and on the onboard","x":76.5,"y":507.1,"w":442.5,"h":12},{"s":"marshalling display or timing monitors.","x":76.5,"y":520.9,"w":204.3,"h":12},{"s":"If a driver does the fourth track limit followed immediately by another track limit, that","x":76.5,"y":534.6,"w":442.5,"h":12},{"s":"driver may be presented the warning flag followed immediately by a report to the","x":76.5,"y":548.4,"w":442.2,"h":12},{"s":"stewards.","x":76.5,"y":562.4,"w":51.6,"h":12},{"s":"A driver can ask via the team manager, to revise a track limit up to 15 min after the","x":76.5,"y":576.2,"w":442.2,"h":12},{"s":"track limit infringement has been done.","x":76.5,"y":589.9,"w":206.2,"h":12},{"s":"In the S„o Paulo drivers briefing it was wrongly said that it was up to 15 minutes after","x":76.5,"y":603.7,"w":442.6,"h":12},{"s":"the infringement was noted.","x":76.5,"y":617.4,"w":147.5,"h":12},{"s":"Our reasoning is the following: If driver is pushed/forced off track, the driver should","x":76.5,"y":631.4,"w":442.6,"h":12},{"s":"communicate the fact immediately.","x":76.5,"y":645.2,"w":185,"h":12},{"s":"Any report to the stewards for track limit infringements is without prejudice to the","x":76.5,"y":659,"w":442.4,"h":12},{"s":"stewards’ final decision regarding whether a penalty will be imposed.","x":76.5,"y":672.7,"w":364.3,"h":12},{"s":"Eduardo Freitas","x":123.3,"y":759.5,"w":70.1,"h":12},{"s":"FIA Race Director","x":119,"y":773,"w":78.2,"h":12},{"s":"Date:","x":257.4,"y":769.2,"w":24.5,"h":12},{"s":"11/07/2026","x":284.6,"y":769.2,"w":49.4,"h":12},{"s":"Time:","x":351.4,"y":769.2,"w":26.2,"h":12},{"s":"19.33","x":380.4,"y":769.2,"w":24.7,"h":12},{"s":"Document N∫:","x":431.7,"y":769.2,"w":64.5,"h":12},{"s":"Posted at: 19:09","x":31.9,"y":29.1,"w":92,"h":12},{"s":"Doc No.: 55","x":498.5,"y":29.1,"w":66,"h":12}]},{"page":2,"width":595.25,"height":842,"items":[{"s":"FIA WEC 2026","x":71,"y":790,"w":53.5,"h":8},{"s":"001 Race Director Communication","x":233.6,"y":790,"w":122.2,"h":8},{"s":"Page 2 of 2","x":478.2,"y":790,"w":41,"h":8}]}]}